WeaveFXP includes C# adaptations of selected cbftp behavior and algorithms.

Source: cbftp-r1310, provided source archive (SHA-256)
5d00f3c67c7b25c0dbf2bbc8a59e78381d039b49d4e0eed74c50d4404f1ea3d8

Adaptations reference transfermonitor.cpp (bounded peer-error cleanup and listing-
observed FXP progress), scoreboard.cpp (shuffle equal scores), engine.cpp /
preparedrace.cpp (explicit prepared spreads, download-only sites and duplicate
announce handling), and sitelogic.cpp / siterace.cpp / refreshgovernor.cpp
(separating hot root discovery from less frequent nested listing work).

